WEBVTT

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:48.966
<i>Kokoro egakidasu</i>

00:00:48.966 --> 00:00:52.386
<i>chizujou no michinaru frontier</i>

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:55.806
<i>Tobira hiraitara</i>

00:00:55.806 --> 00:00:59.142
<i>michi wa tsuzuiteiru yo</i>

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:05.107
<i>Hokori makiagete kimi no machi e</i>

00:01:05.107 --> 00:01:11.822
<i>Sora to daichi ga kasanaru ruuto de</i>

00:01:11.822 --> 00:01:15.576
<i>Hashiru minamikaze ni notte</i>

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:18.495
<i>Aoku somaru kaze wo kitte</i>

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:25.627
<i>Kokorogoto kakedashiteirun da</i>

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:29.298
<i>Mahiru no tsuki wo oikoshite</i>

00:01:29.298 --> 00:01:32.259
<i>Kinou to wa chigau sekai e</i>

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:37.681
<i>Dokomademo hashirinuketeku</i>

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:41.602
<i>Ano kaze no you ni</i>

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:46.899
<i>Ano kaze no you ni</i>

00:01:58.452 --> 00:02:01.330
Yeah, that's right. Something stinks.

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:03.665
Once we've seen what there is to see,
let's get out of here, fast.

00:02:03.665 --> 00:02:06.877
There you go. You'll be all right now, miss.

00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:10.339
There isn't anybody inside
the enemy AS unit I destroyed.

00:02:10.339 --> 00:02:11.882
It's empty!

00:02:11.882 --> 00:02:13.842
Was it controlled remotely or something?

00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:15.594
What the hell is going on...

00:02:31.902 --> 00:02:34.738
It seems we've managed to walk into a trap.

00:02:43.747 --> 00:02:45.832
"Daylight"

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:48.502
He said it's a trap...

00:02:48.502 --> 00:02:50.462
Bring up the ADM data.

00:02:50.462 --> 00:02:52.381
Yes, Captain.

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:57.886
They're spread out all over the place.

00:02:57.886 --> 00:03:03.016
All units are engaged in battle
and unable to properly report.

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:05.352
And because of the difficulty of
communication within the tunnel,

00:03:05.352 --> 00:03:06.687
their data is being disrupted as well.

00:03:06.687 --> 00:03:08.647
At this rate,
Melissa and the others will...

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:33.005
Would you please not struggle?

00:03:33.005 --> 00:03:34.298
A child?

00:03:34.298 --> 00:03:37.259
If you try to fight,
it will only hurt more.

00:03:46.768 --> 00:03:47.811
No way!

00:03:52.816 --> 00:03:54.484
There's not enough room!

00:04:06.705 --> 00:04:08.123
Is it<i> him</i>?

00:04:08.123 --> 00:04:09.958
No, it couldn't be.

00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:11.376
He's...

00:04:13.545 --> 00:04:14.838
He's dead.

00:04:14.838 --> 00:04:16.840
Stay still, now!

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:19.676
Or the bullets will miss!

00:04:26.517 --> 00:04:28.393
Jeez!

00:04:32.731 --> 00:04:33.982
It's not him.

00:04:41.949 --> 00:04:43.242
Well?

00:04:49.623 --> 00:04:51.667
So it is equipped with a Lambda Driver.

00:04:52.751 --> 00:04:55.254
That was close!

00:04:55.254 --> 00:04:59.675
If my sideburns had been just a little
bit shorter, I would've been a goner!

00:04:59.675 --> 00:05:00.592
It's me.

00:05:00.592 --> 00:05:03.178
Any changes in the enemy's response?

00:05:03.178 --> 00:05:05.430
Negative. They're in confusion,
just as planned.

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:08.934
Very well. Continue monitoring
and interference.

00:05:08.934 --> 00:05:10.102
We'll kill every last one of them!

00:05:15.607 --> 00:05:17.526
Uruz 7 to all units.

00:05:17.526 --> 00:05:20.946
I am currently engaging
an enemy AS at 02-11.

00:05:20.946 --> 00:05:22.865
The enemy unit is a Venom type.

00:05:22.865 --> 00:05:26.368
I will proceed to draw him to 01-12.

00:05:26.368 --> 00:05:29.496
Are there any units that can come
in from the east and sandwich him?

00:05:29.496 --> 00:05:31.039
This is HQ to Uruz 7.

00:05:31.039 --> 00:05:33.667
Your coordinates are incorrect.
Please confirm.

00:05:33.667 --> 00:05:36.670
Current position is 02-11. Hurry and...

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:39.548
Give me your accurate coordinates, Uruz 7!

00:05:39.548 --> 00:05:41.675
This is Uruz 7 to HQ. Do you read me?

00:05:41.675 --> 00:05:45.137
I am now going to try proceeding to 01-12...

00:05:45.137 --> 00:05:47.055
Do you read me, Uruz 7?

00:05:47.055 --> 00:05:50.642
This is Uruz 6. I am currently
engaging an enemy AS.

00:05:50.642 --> 00:05:53.020
It's a combat-configured Shadow type.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:56.565
I'm going to try to divert him
somehow and crush him at 03-15.

00:05:56.565 --> 00:06:01.486
Uruz 6, can you confirm Uruz 7 at 02-16?

00:06:01.486 --> 00:06:04.198
Negative! What the hell is going on?

00:06:04.198 --> 00:06:06.575
Things are going exactly as planned.

00:06:06.575 --> 00:06:11.955
If you guys recover now,
it will be bad for my business.

00:06:11.955 --> 00:06:13.498
Oops.

00:06:13.498 --> 00:06:15.959
It's a complaint from their boss.

00:06:19.046 --> 00:06:20.506
This is Ogma 1.

00:06:20.506 --> 00:06:23.550
Captain Bruno, the local
data link is completely disrupted.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:25.052
Explain this!

00:06:25.052 --> 00:06:29.431
I believe it is due to the complex
structure of the tunnel, Captain.

00:06:29.431 --> 00:06:33.435
Leakage and fires are producing
unexpected amounts of static...

00:06:33.435 --> 00:06:35.354
Make improving it your top priority.

00:06:35.354 --> 00:06:36.522
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:37.773 --> 00:06:40.442
We cannot trust the ADM data.

00:06:40.442 --> 00:06:43.278
I am changing the battle control method.

00:06:43.278 --> 00:06:44.196
To manual?

00:06:44.196 --> 00:06:47.574
Yes, with pencil and voice.

00:06:50.786 --> 00:06:53.747
I have to grasp the situation
as quickly as possible.

00:06:53.747 --> 00:06:54.790
Or they'll all be killed.

00:07:15.102 --> 00:07:16.603
I told you, didn't I?

00:07:16.603 --> 00:07:18.647
You'll only hurt more.

00:07:21.024 --> 00:07:23.277
<i>What is this?</i>
<i>It's exactly as if...</i>

00:07:25.404 --> 00:07:28.156
<i>she's devoid of everything, except...</i>

00:07:28.156 --> 00:07:29.992
<i>complete despair.</i>

00:07:32.035 --> 00:07:32.661
Mao!

00:07:32.661 --> 00:07:33.662
Fire!

00:07:54.725 --> 00:07:55.809
She got away.

00:07:55.809 --> 00:07:56.727
Should we go after her?

00:07:56.727 --> 00:07:58.729
No. Our first priority
is to get out of here.

00:07:58.729 --> 00:08:01.523
We need to guide the hostages out,
and make sure they're frisked.

00:08:01.523 --> 00:08:02.858
Who the hell was that girl?

00:08:02.858 --> 00:08:06.987
A "sleeping terrorist."
She was hiding among the hostages.

00:08:06.987 --> 00:08:08.447
But for what purpose?

00:08:08.447 --> 00:08:09.573
Who knows?

00:08:09.573 --> 00:08:10.908
If she only wanted to kill us,

00:08:10.908 --> 00:08:13.869
she could've already done it easily
with a couple of one-pound bombs.

00:08:13.869 --> 00:08:16.246
So she wasn't just trying to kill us?

00:08:16.246 --> 00:08:18.415
They might have been testing us out.

00:08:18.415 --> 00:08:21.460
It feels just like we're
caught in a spider web.

00:08:29.092 --> 00:08:31.720
Shit!

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:32.763
What about the bodies?

00:08:32.763 --> 00:08:34.598
We can't carry them.
We'll leave them here.

00:08:34.598 --> 00:08:35.766
Understood.

00:08:35.766 --> 00:08:38.560
Uruz 2 to all units.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:41.897
Team Ruby has suffered
casualties in an enemy attack.

00:08:41.897 --> 00:08:43.148
Three fatalities.

00:08:43.148 --> 00:08:48.153
Uruz 2 and Team Topaz will now
proceed to move the hostages to 02-16.

00:09:02.543 --> 00:09:06.046
--Connecting FCS to BK540.
--Three fatalities?

00:09:06.046 --> 00:09:07.589
Transmitting to protocol...

00:09:07.589 --> 00:09:10.175
Performing cryptanalysis...

00:09:21.603 --> 00:09:24.356
At this rate, I'll be the fourth fatality!

00:09:24.356 --> 00:09:25.774
This is Uruz 6!

00:09:25.774 --> 00:09:28.735
I'm currently engaging three units at 02-16.

00:09:28.735 --> 00:09:32.239
I need you to direct me out of
here before they get ahead of me!

00:09:32.239 --> 00:09:33.657
HQ to Uruz 6.

00:09:33.657 --> 00:09:37.870
Keep going and move to 03-16.
There shouldn't be any enemies there.

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.038
That's where I came from!

00:09:40.038 --> 00:09:42.916
Understood. Then proceed to 01-14.

00:09:42.916 --> 00:09:45.294
Roger. I'm counting on you, seriously!

00:09:45.294 --> 00:09:47.838
Uruz 2 to HQ.

00:09:47.838 --> 00:09:49.882
Current position is 02-15.

00:09:49.882 --> 00:09:53.760
I'm about to lead the hostages toward 03-14.

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.721
There shouldn't be any enemies there, right?

00:09:55.721 --> 00:09:56.805
Affirmative.

00:09:56.805 --> 00:09:58.807
But be cautious.
There are currently...

00:09:59.933 --> 00:10:01.101
Oh, shit!

00:10:01.101 --> 00:10:02.644
Get back!

00:10:02.644 --> 00:10:03.979
Uruz 2 to HQ.

00:10:03.979 --> 00:10:05.981
The enemy is always one step ahead of us.

00:10:05.981 --> 00:10:07.232
It's difficult to escort.

00:10:07.232 --> 00:10:10.110
I'll have the hostages
escape with Team Topaz.

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.570
Please give me the desired coordinates.

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:14.907
Uruz 2, did the enemies come
from the direction of 03-15?

00:10:14.907 --> 00:10:15.908
Affirmative.

00:10:15.908 --> 00:10:18.952
Understood. Slowly fall back
in the opposite direction.

00:10:18.952 --> 00:10:21.038
Uruz 2, roger.

00:10:21.038 --> 00:10:23.832
--Something's not right. It doesn't make sense.
--Team Topaz has just taken an ambush attack! One lightly wounded!

00:10:23.832 --> 00:10:24.708
--Ma'am?
--Team Topaz has just taken an ambush attack! One lightly wounded!

00:10:24.708 --> 00:10:28.504
--The enemy is reading every move we make.
--This is Uruz 7. 02-11 is full of traps. Detouring around.

00:10:28.504 --> 00:10:30.923
--But it's impossible for the enemy...

00:10:30.923 --> 00:10:33.592
--...to intercept our communications!
--There's an AS behind us, too, so we can't move.

00:10:33.592 --> 00:10:35.844
--Technologically speaking, yes.
--Request support!

00:10:35.844 --> 00:10:38.180
Do you read me? I need new directions!

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:39.515
--This is Uruz 7. Now proceeding to 03-12.

00:10:39.515 --> 00:10:42.226
--Then, how?
--This is Uruz 7. Now proceeding to 03-12.

00:10:42.226 --> 00:10:43.060
You heard that, right?

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:46.063
Uruz 2 gave up on leading the hostages.

00:10:46.063 --> 00:10:48.190
They say they'll slowly fall back.

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.816
Oh, and...

00:10:49.816 --> 00:10:55.322
Uruz 7 reported he's moving to 03-12.

00:10:55.322 --> 00:10:57.199
Uruz 7, huh?

00:10:57.199 --> 00:11:00.786
That machine's name is "Arbalest," right?

00:11:02.246 --> 00:11:05.165
Just surrender yourself
to me like a good boy!

00:11:18.053 --> 00:11:20.973
I messed around with them a little,
just like you asked.

00:11:20.973 --> 00:11:22.933
But now what do I do with them?

00:11:22.933 --> 00:11:25.185
I can kill them all, if necessary.

00:11:25.185 --> 00:11:26.478
Leave 'em alone.

00:11:26.478 --> 00:11:29.398
More importantly,
how were those Mithril guys?

00:11:29.398 --> 00:11:34.528
Nothing special. They are tolerably skilled,
but I think they're too soft.

00:11:34.528 --> 00:11:36.196
How many did you kill?

00:11:36.196 --> 00:11:37.906
Just three men.

00:11:37.906 --> 00:11:41.118
There was one stubborn woman,
but we were interrupted.

00:11:41.118 --> 00:11:42.077
Oh?

00:11:42.077 --> 00:11:44.288
Say, can I go home now?

00:11:44.288 --> 00:11:47.165
This blood that splattered
on me is disgusting.

00:11:47.165 --> 00:11:49.543
I want to take a shower.

00:12:11.106 --> 00:12:12.274
This is Uruz 7.

00:12:12.274 --> 00:12:13.942
I just let the enemy pass me.

00:12:13.942 --> 00:12:17.738
Current position is 03-12.
I will now proceed to assist Uruz 2.

00:12:25.621 --> 00:12:26.288
Cancel that.

00:12:26.288 --> 00:12:27.915
I've been spotted by the enemy.

00:12:27.915 --> 00:12:30.042
This is strange, though.
It's just as if...

00:12:30.042 --> 00:12:31.293
This is Uruz 6.

00:12:31.293 --> 00:12:35.130
Another enemy ambush?
There's no way I can take much more...

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:36.465
Uruz 9 to HQ.

00:12:36.465 --> 00:12:39.968
The enemy is blocking our escape route too!

00:12:39.968 --> 00:12:42.888
If this keeps up,
we're all going to die!

00:12:42.888 --> 00:12:44.181
What is going on here?!

00:12:44.181 --> 00:12:45.432
Don't waste your time!

00:12:45.432 --> 00:12:47.476
It's useless trying to run!

00:12:47.476 --> 00:12:51.146
We put a lot of effort into making sure
everything was prepared for this day!

00:12:52.981 --> 00:12:54.816
There's no doubt about it.

00:12:54.816 --> 00:12:56.860
Information is being leaked.

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:57.903
I agree.

00:12:57.903 --> 00:12:59.112
That's impossible!

00:12:59.112 --> 00:13:00.864
But then, what are we going to do?

00:13:00.864 --> 00:13:04.952
If we can't direct them,
they won't be able to fight effectively.

00:13:04.952 --> 00:13:06.495
I understand that.

00:13:07.955 --> 00:13:11.959
In this case, we must completely
abandon our method of control.

00:13:11.959 --> 00:13:13.877
Abandon?

00:13:13.877 --> 00:13:17.631
But you don't appear to mean that we're
simply going to leave everything up to them.

00:13:17.631 --> 00:13:20.008
No. We will turn the tables on the enemy.

00:13:20.008 --> 00:13:23.762
Do you remember the conversation during
the briefing, Lieutenant Commander?

00:13:23.762 --> 00:13:24.471
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:24.471 --> 00:13:27.766
If everyone remembers it...

00:13:27.766 --> 00:13:28.934
This will be a gamble.

00:13:31.854 --> 00:13:34.481
Dammit! Where are we supposed to go?

00:13:34.481 --> 00:13:37.609
HQ ordered us to go right, but...

00:13:37.609 --> 00:13:39.987
HQ to all units.

00:13:39.987 --> 00:13:41.947
I am issuing top priority orders.

00:13:41.947 --> 00:13:45.117
Does everyone remember
Tony's joke during the briefing?

00:13:46.577 --> 00:13:47.828
Tony?

00:13:47.828 --> 00:13:50.998
When I said to "save the lecture for later."

00:13:50.998 --> 00:13:52.082
We're going to use that method now.

00:13:52.082 --> 00:13:53.458
Lecture? You mean...

00:13:54.835 --> 00:13:57.087
This is just like the Cretans' paradox.

00:13:57.087 --> 00:13:58.213
What's that?

00:13:58.213 --> 00:14:01.425
It's the paradox that's created when
a Cretan says "All Cretans are liars."

00:14:01.425 --> 00:14:03.218
That's what he's talking about?

00:14:06.305 --> 00:14:09.057
What are they talking about?

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:14.104
Well, whatever. I don't need
to worry about it.

00:14:14.104 --> 00:14:18.942
I can hear their entire conversation,
so they can't do a thing.

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:23.363
Now then, tell Uruz 9

00:14:23.363 --> 00:14:26.200
to move carefully to the
left at that T intersection.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:27.951
Move right, and hurry. Got it?

00:14:27.951 --> 00:14:30.579
Uruz 9, roger.

00:14:30.579 --> 00:14:33.290
We're moving. Please stand.

00:14:34.124 --> 00:14:35.125
Hey! That's the wrong...

00:14:35.125 --> 00:14:37.127
Don't worry. This is the right way.

00:14:37.127 --> 00:14:41.173
Have Uruz 2 withdraw to
01-12, to lure out the enemy.

00:14:41.173 --> 00:14:44.927
Uruz 2, advance to 01-10.
Shake off all enemies.

00:14:44.927 --> 00:14:47.095
Uruz 2, roger!

00:14:51.099 --> 00:14:55.521
Have Uruz 6 stand by in that spot and
hold off as many enemies as possible.

00:14:55.521 --> 00:14:58.106
Uruz 6, evacuate that area immediately.

00:14:58.106 --> 00:15:00.317
Do whatever you can to escape the enemy.

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:04.446
Uruz 6, roger!

00:15:07.157 --> 00:15:10.160
Tell Uruz 9 to go further down that tunnel.

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:12.079
Uruz 9, pull back!

00:15:12.079 --> 00:15:14.498
Hurry! Move those feet!

00:15:14.498 --> 00:15:18.335
Roger! Uruz 2, proceeding to 03-12.

00:15:18.335 --> 00:15:21.338
Uruz 6, stay in position
and avoid the enemy.

00:15:21.338 --> 00:15:22.965
Got it.

00:15:22.965 --> 00:15:25.092
"Create a diversion, and lure the enemy..."

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:27.886
Oops!

00:15:27.886 --> 00:15:30.722
Uruz 9, advance toward 03.

00:15:30.722 --> 00:15:31.557
Roger.

00:15:31.557 --> 00:15:38.355
Uruz 7, double back and avoid Route 2.
Then proceed to Point 04-05.

00:15:38.355 --> 00:15:40.482
Uruz 7, roger.

00:15:40.482 --> 00:15:43.193
Captain, the enemy's target is...

00:15:43.193 --> 00:15:45.112
Yes. The Arbalest.

00:15:51.201 --> 00:15:52.452
Yu Fang?

00:15:52.452 --> 00:15:54.663
What? I'm a little busy right now...

00:15:54.663 --> 00:15:57.165
How long are you going to let
the small fry give you trouble?

00:15:57.165 --> 00:15:59.001
It's about time to go
get what we came here for!

00:15:59.001 --> 00:16:01.336
Clean things up and get
your butt over here already!

00:16:13.348 --> 00:16:17.019
This is 103. I'm standing by
at the given point.

00:16:17.019 --> 00:16:18.270
When is the enemy coming?

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:20.022
Are you sure these are
the right coordinates?

00:16:20.022 --> 00:16:22.774
Same here. No one's coming.
What's going on?

00:16:22.774 --> 00:16:27.779
Stop your whining.
You guys just do as you're ordered.

00:16:27.779 --> 00:16:30.490
We're reading every
one of their moves.

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:33.911
Just stay calm and wait
there for your prey to come!

00:16:33.911 --> 00:16:36.246
Uruz 6, from there,
escape to the northeast.

00:16:36.246 --> 00:16:38.957
You have permission to
engage the enemy at will.

00:16:38.957 --> 00:16:41.084
Uruz 6, roger.

00:16:41.084 --> 00:16:43.253
Uruz 2, hold your position.
You are forbidden to move,

00:16:43.253 --> 00:16:45.547
--especially towards 04-05!

00:16:45.547 --> 00:16:46.256
--Something ain't right.
--especially towards 04-05!

00:16:46.256 --> 00:16:48.008
--Something ain't right.
--Uruz 2, roger.

00:16:48.008 --> 00:16:49.301
Uruz 9, have you reached

00:16:49.301 --> 00:16:49.718
--the designated location?

00:16:49.718 --> 00:16:50.886
--It makes no sense.
--the designated location?

00:16:50.886 --> 00:16:51.678
--It makes no sense.
--Affirmative.

00:16:51.678 --> 00:16:54.389
--They couldn't be trying to outwit us, could they?
--Good. There should be stairs leading...

00:16:54.389 --> 00:16:57.351
--By giving completely opposite orders?
--shaft in front of you. Do <i>not </i>climb them. Proceed straight ahead.

00:16:57.351 --> 00:17:00.854
--Impossible. No one could possibly...
--Uruz 9, roger.

00:17:19.164 --> 00:17:20.749
Something's wrong.

00:17:35.264 --> 00:17:36.557
Good, good, good!

00:17:36.557 --> 00:17:38.267
I'm getting close!

00:17:38.267 --> 00:17:42.729
The only thing in front of me is one
Arbalest on the verge of overheating!

00:17:42.729 --> 00:17:45.858
I'm going to chase it down,
surround it, and crush it under my heel!

00:17:45.858 --> 00:17:48.986
I have him trapped like a rat!

00:17:51.238 --> 00:17:53.282
This is where we finish it!

00:18:01.081 --> 00:18:04.793
What? Where's the Arbalest?

00:18:08.297 --> 00:18:09.381
Huh?

00:18:09.381 --> 00:18:11.008
Our prey is caught in the net!

00:18:11.008 --> 00:18:14.136
Impressive, isn't it?
It's just like magic!

00:18:14.136 --> 00:18:15.470
HQ to all units.

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:19.474
Listen up. The story
about the Cretans is over.

00:18:19.474 --> 00:18:22.060
Fire at will. Eradicate the enemy!

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:23.228
Roger!

00:18:25.397 --> 00:18:27.274
No way! No way! No way!

00:18:27.274 --> 00:18:29.067
What the hell is this?

00:18:29.067 --> 00:18:31.778
So I was the rat?

00:18:31.778 --> 00:18:33.655
Dammit! Our bullets aren't
even putting a dent in it!

00:18:33.655 --> 00:18:35.532
Is that the Lambda Driver?

00:18:35.532 --> 00:18:36.867
Looks like it.

00:18:36.867 --> 00:18:39.703
Sousuke, can you take him?

00:18:39.703 --> 00:18:40.746
Roger!

00:18:57.721 --> 00:19:02.643
Weak! Weak! You're so frickin' weak!

00:19:03.727 --> 00:19:05.771
What's going on?
You still can't use it?!

00:19:05.771 --> 00:19:07.356
I don't understand it either!

00:19:07.356 --> 00:19:08.774
It won't operate the way I want it to!

00:19:08.774 --> 00:19:11.777
You thought you had me outwitted,
didn't you? But not quite!

00:19:11.777 --> 00:19:14.363
But man, you really disappoint me.

00:19:14.363 --> 00:19:17.574
If that's all it can do,
it's not even worth taking.

00:19:17.574 --> 00:19:20.494
I'll just kill you all off right here!

00:19:25.541 --> 00:19:27.167
Well, shit. I'll have to take that back.

00:19:27.167 --> 00:19:28.293
Click.

00:19:32.297 --> 00:19:33.590
What?

00:19:38.387 --> 00:19:41.932
I'm not upset about this one little bit!

00:19:41.932 --> 00:19:45.894
I'm not upset about this! Remember that!

00:19:46.728 --> 00:19:50.148
Cease hostilities!
All units, evacuate!

00:19:50.148 --> 00:19:52.150
I repeat, evacuate!

00:19:53.277 --> 00:19:55.237
Explosion detected at 04-05.

00:19:55.237 --> 00:19:57.155
Large-scale flooding is occurring.

00:19:57.155 --> 00:19:58.740
Most communications are down.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:01.243
We cannot contact our teams.

00:20:01.243 --> 00:20:02.327
Captain?

00:20:02.327 --> 00:20:05.706
It will be okay. M9s were designed
to operate both on land and in water.

00:20:05.706 --> 00:20:07.666
The flooding falls within our predictions.

00:20:07.666 --> 00:20:10.794
This is Uruz 8. HQ, do you read me?

00:20:10.794 --> 00:20:13.922
We're in Bruno's room right now,
but we were too late.

00:20:13.922 --> 00:20:15.299
He's gone.

00:20:15.299 --> 00:20:16.592
It was probably him.

00:20:24.892 --> 00:20:27.269
Looks like we made it out somehow.

00:20:27.269 --> 00:20:28.604
Are you alive, Kurz?

00:20:29.813 --> 00:20:31.857
Afraid so.

00:20:34.943 --> 00:20:36.445
How about you?

00:20:36.445 --> 00:20:38.155
No problem.

00:20:38.155 --> 00:20:41.825
Anyway, so there's a traitor in Mithril?

00:20:41.825 --> 00:20:45.829
Yeah. Remember the guy who brought
us the transmitters this morning?

00:20:45.829 --> 00:20:48.457
That guy from Intelligence, Bruno.

00:20:48.457 --> 00:20:49.833
Seems like it was him.

00:20:49.833 --> 00:20:51.585
That guy? Dammit.

00:20:51.585 --> 00:20:53.795
We got into some pretty
hot water because of him.

00:20:53.795 --> 00:20:57.674
We need to pay that bastard back
good for everything he did to us.

00:20:57.674 --> 00:20:58.926
Yeah...

00:21:00.052 --> 00:21:01.512
Uruz 2 to HQ.

00:21:01.512 --> 00:21:03.555
Everyone in the AS team is safe.

00:21:03.555 --> 00:21:05.432
We will now proceed to the rendezvous point.

00:21:05.432 --> 00:21:08.435
Thank goodness. I will send over a helicopter.

00:21:08.435 --> 00:21:10.979
You saved our lives, Tessa.

00:21:10.979 --> 00:21:13.315
I'm grateful, Captain.

00:21:13.315 --> 00:21:16.401
Thank you. Please stay alert
until the very end.

00:21:27.829 --> 00:21:29.748
Useless piece of junk.

00:21:37.881 --> 00:21:41.927
In the end, we failed
to capture the Arbalest.

00:21:41.927 --> 00:21:45.138
All we accomplished was ruining a tunnel.

00:21:45.138 --> 00:21:46.974
And the armistice agreement too.

00:21:46.974 --> 00:21:49.852
I really do hate that man.

00:21:49.852 --> 00:21:53.021
You never know what he's thinking.

00:21:53.021 --> 00:21:57.568
It will be okay.
Let's just do as Sensei told us.

00:21:57.568 --> 00:22:00.487
We just have to be patient until then.

00:22:00.487 --> 00:22:02.114
Big Sis...

00:22:02.114 --> 00:22:03.866
What?

00:22:03.866 --> 00:22:06.159
It's cold here.

00:22:06.159 --> 00:22:09.663
You're right. Let's go home.

00:22:27.764 --> 00:22:33.312
<i>Kitto kimi wa kyou no hi mo</i>

00:22:33.312 --> 00:22:39.193
<i>Massugu ashita wo miteru</i>

00:22:39.193 --> 00:22:44.907
<i>Kaze ga fuku ano oka ni saita</i>

00:22:44.907 --> 00:22:51.663
<i>himawari no you ni</i>

00:22:53.582 --> 00:22:59.505
<i>Donna ni tooku hanareteite mo</i>

00:22:59.505 --> 00:23:05.511
<i>Kono utagoe ga kimi ni todoku you ni</i>

00:23:05.511 --> 00:23:11.558
<i>Namida ga zutto tomaranai yoru</i>

00:23:11.558 --> 00:23:17.898
<i>Kimi no mado wo terasu tsuki ni naritai</i>

00:23:17.898 --> 00:23:25.948
<i>Mata kanarazu aeru to</i>

00:23:28.283 --> 00:23:31.870
<i>Sou omou kara</i>

00:23:45.259 --> 00:23:46.426
"Next Episode"

00:23:46.426 --> 00:23:50.472
<i>The traitor had hidden himself</i>
<i>within a powerful mafia.</i>

00:23:50.472 --> 00:23:52.724
<i>The wind off of the</i>
<i>Mediterranean, an unspoken rule,</i>

00:23:52.724 --> 00:23:56.645
<i>an unexpected riotous scene,</i>
<i>and a jet-black assailant.</i>

00:23:56.645 --> 00:23:59.439
<i>Next time: "Beautiful Sicily."</i>

00:23:59.439 --> 00:24:01.400
<i>Even if you try running</i>
<i>to the ends of the Earth,</i>

00:24:01.400 --> 00:24:04.715
<i>I will chase you down.</i>
